  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "ソルガレオか　ルナアーラと\nがったいした　ネクロズマを\nあらたな　すがたにする　けっしょう。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "솔가레오나 루나아라와\n합체한 네크로즈마를\n새로운 모습으로 만드는 결정.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "可讓和索爾迦雷歐或露奈雅拉\n合體後的奈克洛茲瑪\n展現出全新樣子的結晶。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un cristal permettant de donner une nouvelle forme\nà Necrozma quand il a fusionné avec Solgaleo ou\nLunala.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Kristallisierte Z-Kraft, die bei Necrozma nach der\nFusion mit Solgaleo oder Lunala bewirkt, dass es\neine neue Form annimmt.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Cristal que permite a Necrozma, una vez fusionado\ncon Solgaleo o Lunala, adoptar una nueva forma.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Cristallo che permette a Necrozma di assumere una\nnuova forma quando è fuso con Lunala o Solgaleo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "It’s a crystal that turns Necrozma fused with\nSolgaleo or Lunala into a new form.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
